  "title": "BBS Machinima pack",
  "description": "All you need in performance and decoration to make good machinimas with the BBS Mod, by McHorse!",
  "body": "# **The Perfect Modpack to make Machinimas**\nThat modpack is made by Nioum, because nobody should lag during making machinimas with good shaders.\n\n![Features](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a878121721f35acb126ff78db905ea7d64591736.png)\n\n💙 BBS Mod, made to make animations in Minecraft.\n⚠️ Starting from 3.4.3, the modpack now uses BBS CML Edition, the fan continuation.\n\n💙 Fully optimized mods - with Shader Support (Sodium & Iris, Noisium, ImmediatelyFast,...)\n\n💙 Contains decoration mods (Explosive Enhancement, Falling Leaves,...)\n\n💙 Integration of Essential, to make Machinimas with your friends!",
